  "description": "A lightweight, node-based AI workflow engine for .NET 10. Build AI pipelines by chaining reusable nodes — LLM calls, HTTP requests, data transforms, embeddings, conditionals, and more — with built-in retry, timeout, parallel execution, and structured logging.",
  "id": "TwfAiFramework",
